{"id":"goygol","qid":"Q1026631","category":"city","type":"oikonym","names":{"az":"Göygöl","ru":"Гёйгёль","en":"Goygol"},"coordinates":[46.3239,40.5905],"coordinatesSource":"wd","region":"gence-daskesen","regionSource":"wp-az-regions","admin":[{"qid":"Q388087","az":"Göygöl rayonu","en":"Goygol District"}],"firstRecord":{"year":1819,"precision":"year","bce":false,"kind":"inception","source":"wd"},"period":"modern","forms":[{"form":"Yelenendorf","lang":"az","from":1812,"to":1938,"sources":["wd"]},{"form":"Еленендорф","lang":"ru","to":1938,"sources":["wd","wp-ru"],"from":1819},{"form":"Ханлар","lang":"ru","from":1938,"to":2008,"sources":["wd","wp-ru"]},{"form":"Xanlar","lang":"az","from":1938,"to":2008,"sources":["wd"]},{"form":"Гёйгёль","lang":"ru","from":2008,"current":true,"sources":["wd"]}],"namedAfter":[],"etymology":[],"summary":{"az":{"text":"Göygöl — Azərbaycan Respublikasının Göygöl rayonunun Göygöl şəhər inzibati ərazi dairəsində şəhər, Göygöl rayonunun inzibati mərkəzi. 1938-ci ildə rayon tabeli şəhər statusu almışdır. Azərbaycan Respublikası Milli Məclisinin 25 aprel 2008-ci il tarixli Qərarı ilə şəhər Göygöl adlandırılmışdır.\n22 avqust 1819-cu ildə Azərbaycanda ilk alman koloniyası — Yelenendorf (indiki Göygöl) qəsəbəsinin əsası qoyulub. Almanların Qafqaza köçü 1817-ci ildə Rusiya çarının razılığı ilə başlanmışdı.","truncated":true,"source":"wp-az"},"ru":{"text":"Гёйгёль (азерб. Göygöl, то есть «голубое озеро») — город в Азербайджане, административный центр Гёйгёльского района. \nОснован в 1819 году как колония Еленендорф швабскими колонистами из Швабии. В 1931 году был переименован в Еленино, с 1938 года по 2008 год — носил имя Ханлар революционера Х. Сафаралиева.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-ru"},"en":{"text":"Goygol (Azerbaijani: Göygöl, German: Helenendorf) (Yelenino in 1931–1938, Khanlar in 1938–2008) is a city, municipality and the capital of the Goygol District in northwestern Azerbaijan. It is around 10 km (6 mi) south of Azerbaijan's third-largest city, Ganja. The city of Goygol has a population of 37,200 (est. 2010). The municipality includes the city of Goygol and the village of Qızılqaya.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-en"}},"images":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8e/Helenendorf_HAliyevStreet_004_4412.jpg/960px-Helenendorf_HAliyevStreet_004_4412.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","small":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8e/Helenendorf_HAliyevStreet_004_4412.jpg/960px-Helenendorf_HAliyevStreet_004_4412.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","width":800,"height":498,"page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Helenendorf_HAliyevStreet_004_4412.jpg","title":"Helenendorf HAliyevStreet 004 4412.jpg","artist":"Ludvig14","credit":"Own work","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","source":"img-1"}],"sources":[{"id":"wd","kind":"wikidata","title":"Wikidata Q1026631: Goygol","publisher":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q1026631","licence":"CC0 1.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-az","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"az","title":"Göygöl (şəhər)","publisher":"Vikipediya (azərbaycanca)","url":"https://az.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=G%C3%B6yg%C3%B6l_(%C5%9F%C9%99h%C9%99r)&oldid=9124086","pageUrl":"https://az.wikipedia.org/wiki/G%C3%B6yg%C3%B6l_(%C5%9F%C9%99h%C9%99r)","revid":9124086,"revDate":"2026-09-28","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-ru","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"ru","title":"Гёйгёль (город)","publisher":"Википедия (на русском)","url":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%D0%93%D1%91%D0%B9%D0%B3%D1%91%D0%BB%D1%8C_(%D0%B3%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B4)&oldid=154918490","pageUrl":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%93%D1%91%D0%B9%D0%B3%D1%91%D0%BB%D1%8C_(%D0%B3%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B4)","revid":154918490,"revDate":"2026-09-09","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-en","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"en","title":"Goygol (city)","publisher":"Wikipedia (English)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Goygol_(city)&oldid=1377781885","pageUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Goygol_(city)","revid":1377781885,"revDate":"2026-10-01","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-az-regions","kind":"wikipedia","lang":"az","title":"Azərbaycanın iqtisadi rayonları","publisher":"Vikipediya (azərbaycanca)","url":"https://az.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=Az%C9%99rbaycan%C4%B1n_iqtisadi_rayonlar%C4%B1&oldid=9209860","pageUrl":"https://az.wikipedia.org/wiki/Az%C9%99rbaycan%C4%B1n_iqtisadi_rayonlar%C4%B1","revid":9209860,"revDate":"2026-11-19","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"img-1","kind":"commons","title":"File:Helenendorf HAliyevStreet 004 4412.jpg","publisher":"Wikimedia Commons","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Helenendorf_HAliyevStreet_004_4412.jpg","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"}],"langs":["az","ru","en"],"verification":"sourced"}